- Update to version 26.8.0 (from 26.3.3):
  * New "add resource playbook" for simple playbook scaffolding
  * schema subcommand output now includes validation metadata
  * init: add --include/--exclude options for resource bundles
  * Execution environment: build_arg_defaults support for EE projects
  * Execution environment: scaffold spec files for GitLab CI
  * Execution environment: option to disable validate_certs
  * Execution environment: fixed missing build stages and ordering
  * Security: constrain cairosvg (CVE-2026-31899) and upgrade pillow

